        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "ff49be01-0b1a-3c3d-b1b5-7a2f892a4238",
                "word": "важно",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30dba1d4-08a6-3402-979e-3cac42181cbe",
                        "entry_id": "ff49be01-0b1a-3c3d-b1b5-7a2f892a4238",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к важный; исполнившись достоинства, с серьёзностью; величаво, горделиво"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "00a768e3-040c-4f62-a083-c914e043c4b3",
                                "sense_id": "30dba1d4-08a6-3402-979e-3cac42181cbe",
                                "text": "Перекрестясь, он важно сел // И пленника подвесть велел."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e56bfe5a-338e-3218-b8b5-2f15e9b6fb4d",
                        "entry_id": "ff49be01-0b1a-3c3d-b1b5-7a2f892a4238",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предик. оценочная характеристика чего-либо как имеющего большое значение, существенного, значительного, заслуживающего внимания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0b662ab-609e-4313-b55b-d36dd06427ad",
                                "sense_id": "e56bfe5a-338e-3218-b8b5-2f15e9b6fb4d",
                                "text": "Важно было приобрести животных некованых, с крепкими копытами."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ed72181c-1aff-32fc-9e0e-503c8691933c",
                        "entry_id": "ff49be01-0b1a-3c3d-b1b5-7a2f892a4238",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. разг. хорошо, отлично"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d71128b-5ad6-4946-b4c5-ce46bd64b6ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff49be01-0b1a-3c3d-b1b5-7a2f892a4238",
                        "source_sense_description": "наречие",
                        "target_lang_word": "grandly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "grandly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84035f88-0c7b-315f-87c9-ff6115b8de6e",
                                        "entry_id": "e04e5094-19c2-3b8b-b24f-8ef5e44ca306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a grand manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee1301e5-caf5-4855-bbca-57a2be4dc7bc",
                                                "sense_id": "84035f88-0c7b-315f-87c9-ff6115b8de6e",
                                                "text": "This slight way of treating both his book and his ancestors nettled little Puddock – who never himself took a liberty, and expected similar treatment – but he knew Sturk, the nature of the beast, and he only bowed grandly […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c3545a6-2c26-4e90-a846-79964d536fe9",
                                                "sense_id": "84035f88-0c7b-315f-87c9-ff6115b8de6e",
                                                "text": "“Take the Concorde. Spend a lot of money. Get yourself there in the most expensive way possible, take pictures over ten times if you need to. Do it all grandly!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4dedd75-91fa-3dd0-9a4c-122011097d39",
                                        "entry_id": "e04e5094-19c2-3b8b-b24f-8ef5e44ca306",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To the greatest extent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24617f84-45de-45d5-ad07-97c04389eb25",
                                                "sense_id": "e4dedd75-91fa-3dd0-9a4c-122011097d39",
                                                "text": "But whether or not Sumner was the most typical man of his native commonwealth, he certainly does take a representative place on the bede-roll of her great sons. And on a wider field he does especially and grandly represent the Puritan spirit and the Pilgrim idea, and so the peculiar ethical and political idea of our whole nation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02aedff8-533f-4444-8d82-3c6b8197a957",
                                                "sense_id": "e4dedd75-91fa-3dd0-9a4c-122011097d39",
                                                "text": "The world had appreciated what he had done, and had put much to his credit, and he was prepared to draw upon this grandly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0809b4b-482d-4538-86c1-4fd9a1df38ef",
                                                "sense_id": "e4dedd75-91fa-3dd0-9a4c-122011097d39",
                                                "text": "Thus happily unfolding his plans, his work enlarged grandly. He was living in high hopes of spending uninterruptedly the greater part of his life in China."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b534eae-d159-4e0c-9dff-d6565a920a4d",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff49be01-0b1a-3c3d-b1b5-7a2f892a4238",
                        "source_sense_description": "наречие",
                        "target_lang_word": "wichtig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wichtig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14db02b3-8401-3c42-875f-663427f3bad1",
                                        "entry_id": "5e748b88-c2ca-36d7-8828-4eb65465b271",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "wesentlich sein, von Gewicht, Bedeutung sein; Gewicht, Bedeutung habend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fd8e368-ba37-4ffd-b037-8322f8deef35",
                                                "sense_id": "14db02b3-8401-3c42-875f-663427f3bad1",
                                                "text": "Es ist ihm wichtig, dass du es weißt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e818ed0-f178-4d8c-838a-6c7bd5dd7c1a",
                                                "sense_id": "14db02b3-8401-3c42-875f-663427f3bad1",
                                                "text": "Er tut sehr wichtig. (Er ist ein Wichtigtuer)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7505dc64-c502-4ab9-87e2-b811590162ad",
                                                "sense_id": "14db02b3-8401-3c42-875f-663427f3bad1",
                                                "text": "„Doch was bei den beiden wichtigsten Erzählern der frühen nachrömischen Geschichte Britanniens übereinstimmend nach Völkermord klingt, sehen heutige Fachleute weniger eindeutig.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48ad41b6-3f4a-4d2e-b8f3-d8944ba50ea5",
                                                "sense_id": "14db02b3-8401-3c42-875f-663427f3bad1",
                                                "text": "„Bei akuten Verbrennungen ist das wichtigste Gegenmittel kaltes Leitungswasser.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53b0f6d4-eb9c-47e1-8c5b-8e263bba7d9e",
                                                "sense_id": "14db02b3-8401-3c42-875f-663427f3bad1",
                                                "text": "„Jeder glücklich erreichte Gipfel vermittelt das Bewusstsein, sich ein nicht jedermann zugängliches, dem Bergsteiger wichtiges Stück Bergwelt unseres Globus selbst erarbeitet und damit zu eigen gemacht zu haben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "610a0126-c11a-44ec-8fdf-0971fd8255f1",
                                                "sense_id": "14db02b3-8401-3c42-875f-663427f3bad1",
                                                "text": "„Bewegen ist wichtig, ja, solange bis man nicht mehr kann!“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cd4f6d7f-76bd-4652-8c14-797bb52f084c",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff49be01-0b1a-3c3d-b1b5-7a2f892a4238",
